message: "If you use the Open Diké Leaderboard, please cite this software."

title: "Open Diké Leaderboard"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"

authors:
  - family-names: "Proskurina"
    given-names: "Irina"

repository-code: "https://github.com/upunaprosk/dice-leaderboard"

abstract: >
  Open Diké Leaderboard is an evaluation framework and leaderboard
  for studying bias, fairness, toxicity, ethics, and safety in base
  and instruction-tuned compressed large language models.

keywords:
  - large language models
  - model compression
  - fairness
  - bias
  - toxicity
  - ethics
  - safety
  - evaluation
